#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:99
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Métodos"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:103
msgid "Turn off the I2C bus."
msgstr "Apaga el bus I2C."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:107
msgid "Initialise the I2C bus with the given parameters:"
msgstr "Inicializa el bus I2C con los parámetros indicados:"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:109
msgid "``mode`` must be either ``I2C.CONTROLLER`` or ``I2C.PERIPHERAL``."
msgstr "``mode`` debe ser ``I2C.CONTROLLER`` o ``I2C.PERIPHERAL``."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:110
msgid "``addr`` is the 7-bit address (only sensible for a peripheral)."
msgstr ""
"``addr`` es la dirección de 7 bits (solo tiene sentido para un periférico)."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:111
msgid "``baudrate`` is the SCL clock rate (only sensible for a controller)."
msgstr ""
"``baudrate`` es la frecuencia de reloj de SCL (solo tiene sentido para un "
"controlador)."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:112
msgid "``gencall`` is whether to support general-call mode."
msgstr ""
"``gencall`` indica si se admite el modo de llamada general (general-call)."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:113
msgid ""
"``dma`` is whether to allow the use of DMA for the I2C transfers (note that "
"DMA transfers have more precise timing but currently do not handle bus "
"errors properly)."
msgstr ""
"``dma`` indica si se permite el uso de DMA para las transferencias I2C (ten "
"en cuenta que las transferencias DMA tienen una temporización más precisa, "
"pero actualmente no gestionan correctamente los errores de bus)."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:117
msgid ""
"The actual clock frequency may be lower than the requested frequency. This "
"is dependent on the platform hardware. The actual rate may be determined by "
"printing the I2C object."
msgstr ""
"La frecuencia de reloj real puede ser inferior a la frecuencia solicitada. "
"Esto depende del hardware de la plataforma. La frecuencia real puede "
"determinarse imprimiendo el objeto I2C."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:123
msgid ""
"Check if an I2C device responds to the given address.  Only valid when in "
"controller mode."
msgstr ""
"Comprueba si un dispositivo I2C responde a la dirección indicada. Solo es "
"válido en modo controlador."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:127
msgid "Read from the memory of an I2C device:"
msgstr "Lee de la memoria de un dispositivo I2C:"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:129
msgid ""
"``data`` can be an integer (number of bytes to read) or a buffer to read "
"into"
msgstr ""
"``data`` puede ser un entero (número de bytes a leer) o un búfer en el que "
"leer"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:130
msgid "``addr`` is the I2C device address"
msgstr "``addr`` es la dirección del dispositivo I2C"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:131
msgid "``memaddr`` is the memory location within the I2C device"
msgstr "``memaddr`` es la ubicación de memoria dentro del dispositivo I2C"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:132
msgid "``timeout`` is the timeout in milliseconds to wait for the read"
msgstr "``timeout`` es el tiempo de espera en milisegundos para la lectura"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:133
msgid "``addr_size`` selects width of memaddr: 8 or 16 bits"
msgstr "``addr_size`` selecciona el ancho de memaddr: 8 o 16 bits"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:135
msgid "Returns the read data. This is only valid in controller mode."
msgstr "Devuelve los datos leídos. Esto solo es válido en modo controlador."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:140
msgid "Write to the memory of an I2C device:"
msgstr "Escribe en la memoria de un dispositivo I2C:"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:142
msgid "``data`` can be an integer or a buffer to write from."
msgstr "``data`` puede ser un entero o un búfer desde el que escribir."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:143
msgid "``addr`` is the I2C device address."
msgstr "``addr`` es la dirección del dispositivo I2C."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:144
msgid "``memaddr`` is the memory location within the I2C device."
msgstr "``memaddr`` es la ubicación de memoria dentro del dispositivo I2C."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:145
msgid "``timeout`` is the timeout in milliseconds to wait for the write."
msgstr "``timeout`` es el tiempo de espera en milisegundos para la escritura."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:146
msgid "``addr_size`` selects width of ``memaddr``: 8 or 16 bits."
msgstr "``addr_size`` selecciona el ancho de ``memaddr``: 8 o 16 bits."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:148
msgid "Only valid in controller mode."
msgstr "Solo es válido en modo controlador."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:152
msgid "Receive data on the bus:"
msgstr "Recibe datos en el bus:"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:154
msgid ""
"``recv`` can be an integer, which is the number of bytes to receive, or a "
"mutable buffer, which will be filled with received bytes"
msgstr ""
"``recv`` puede ser un entero, que es el número de bytes a recibir, o un "
"búfer mutable, que se rellenará con los bytes recibidos"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:156
msgid ""
"``addr`` is the address to receive from (only required in controller mode)"
msgstr ""
"``addr`` es la dirección de la que recibir (solo se requiere en modo "
"controlador)"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:157
msgid "``timeout`` is the timeout in milliseconds to wait for the receive"
msgstr "``timeout`` es el tiempo de espera en milisegundos para la recepción"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:159
msgid ""
"Return value: if ``recv`` is an integer then a new buffer of the bytes "
"received, otherwise the same buffer that was passed in to ``recv``."
msgstr ""
"Valor de retorno: si ``recv`` es un entero, entonces un nuevo búfer con los "
"bytes recibidos; de lo contrario, el mismo búfer que se pasó a ``recv``."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:164
msgid "Send data on the bus:"
msgstr "Envía datos en el bus:"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:166
msgid "``send`` is the data to send (an integer to send, or a buffer object)."
msgstr ""
"``send`` son los datos a enviar (un entero para enviar, o un objeto búfer)."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:167
msgid "``addr`` is the address to send to (only required in controller mode)."
msgstr ""
"``addr`` es la dirección a la que enviar (solo se requiere en modo "
"controlador)."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:168
msgid "``timeout`` is the timeout in milliseconds to wait for the send."
msgstr "``timeout`` es el tiempo de espera en milisegundos para el envío."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:172
msgid ""
"Scan all I2C addresses from 0x01 to 0x7f and return a list of those that "
"respond. Only valid when in controller mode."
msgstr ""
"Escanea todas las direcciones I2C desde 0x01 hasta 0x7f y devuelve una lista"
" de las que responden. Solo es válido en modo controlador."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:176
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Constantes"

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:181
msgid ""
"Initialises the bus as the master (controller) -- it drives ``SCL`` and "
"initiates transactions."
msgstr ""
"Inicializa el bus como maestro (controlador) -- acciona ``SCL`` e inicia las"
" transacciones."

#: ../../library/pyb.I2C.rst:187
msgid ""
"Initialises the bus as a slave (peripheral) that listens on the ``addr`` set"
" in :meth:`init` and responds to transactions started by a controller on the"
" same bus."
msgstr ""
"Inicializa el bus como esclavo (periférico) que escucha en la dirección "
"``addr`` establecida en :meth:`init` y responde a las transacciones "
"iniciadas por un controlador en el mismo bus."
